'''Stacy L. Tutt III''' (born August 8, 1982) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[Fullback (American football)|fullback]] for the [[New York Jets]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Richmond Spiders football|Richmond Spiders]] and was signed by the Jets as an [[undrafted free agent]] in 2006.

